4. Par l'entremise de la mise en oeuvre du laissez-passer Un Canada fort, les établissements du patrimoine donnent l'accès gratuit ou à tarif réduit aux enfants et aux jeunes;                                                                                   5. Les enfants et les jeunes bénéficient d'un meilleur accès à leur patrimoine culturel.

expected_results_en:
1. Exhibitions and public programming products/activities are produced;
2. Opportunities are created for heritage institutions and workers to enhance their professional knowledge, skills and practices;                                                        3. Projects to improve the preservation and presentation of Indigenous heritage are implemented; 
4. Through the implementation of the Canada Strong Pass, heritage institutions provide children and youth with free or discounted admission;                                                                               5. Children and youth are provided with improved access to their cultural heritage.

